	"decisions": [
		"This proves reuse of the palette, style bible, template and import workflow for a second character; it is not full second-job motion coverage. Idle, walk, back views, ready back and other head views stay native.",
		"The concept is a female scholar; the only native templates here are the male Swordsman body and male novice head, so the art is a costume and hairstyle adaptation onto those silhouettes. A female template would need female native sources, which this study does not include.",
		"The concept's beret, ribbon and pin are not drawn into the head; cap/hat remain separate native modules.",
		"The optional ready-front 55-59 module is not selected or promised by this proof; the ready animation explicitly includes native drawings except replacement slot 54.",
		"Codex independently reviewed the strict-passing generated drawings and the merged game-actor contact sheets (2026-10-02). This records Codex review; user approval is not recorded. See logs/completion-2026-10-02/ for visual and runtime evidence."
	]
